{
	"description": "Replayed by the three drivers and the hotstring editor against _shared/hotstrings/data/magic_key.json (Lua: _shared/tests/lua/hotstrings/magic_key_contract.lua; AutoHotkey: windows/tests/unit/hotstrings/test_magic_key_rules.ahk; JavaScript: tools/test/test-magic-key-rules.cjs). layout_default: the base-level text of each probed key (an absent key types nothing) and the default it gives, the manifest default being fallback. display: the configured character and what a text written with the marker shows.",
	"fallback": "★",
